{"parentUuid":"bbba23c1-8378-4eb4-9eea-8f374f8bc23e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CemxXu6PQfwSxK98yy5vS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":609,"cache_read_input_tokens":253965,"output_tokens":704,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":72},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":609,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":704,"cache_read_input_tokens":253965,"cache_creation_input_tokens":609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":609},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CemxXkE5suvLP2CojZaY4","type":"assistant","uuid":"327287dc-ccad-4bad-b6b9-e0fa3098a66b","timestamp":"2026-09-06T09:35:22.492Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek","sessionId":"fcec3b82-fe78-4cb6-b1dc-40e4f8a72893","version":"2.1.263","gitBranch":"docs/project-details","slug":"buzzing-baking-crystal"}
{"parentUuid":"327287dc-ccad-4bad-b6b9-e0fa3098a66b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CemxXu6PQfwSxK98yy5vS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Committed as [446a2f3](.). Test sweep green (41 passed).\n\n**New \"Ask\" page** in the dashboard — a chat layer backed by Databricks Genie:\n\n- **[adapters/genie.py](src/devmemory/adapters/genie.py)** — `GenieAdapter` over the SDK's Genie Conversation API. One call per turn (`start_conversation_and_wait` / `create_message_and_wait`), returns the answer text, the SQL Genie generated, and up to 50 result rows. Follow-ups reuse the `conversation_id` so Genie keeps context. Degrades gracefully — no creds / no space id / no `databricks` extra → the page shows setup instructions, not an error.\n- **API** — `GET /api/genie/status`, `POST /api/genie/ask`.\n- **Config** — `databricks.genie_space_id` in `config.json`, or `DATABRICKS_GENIE_SPACE_ID` env.\n- **UI** — [Ask.tsx](src/devmemory/web/frontend/src/routes/Ask.tsx): sidebar entry, suggestion chips, message thread with answer + row table + collapsible SQL, \"New chat\" reset.\n\nVerified with headless screenshots in both states (unconfigured → setup card; configured → chat UI).\n\n**To make it live:**\n1. In Databricks, create a **Genie space** scoped to the `devmemory.analytics` schema (run `devmemory databricks push` / sync first so the tables have data).\n2. Set `DATABRICKS_GENIE_SPACE_ID` (+ the existing `DATABRICKS_HOST`/`TOKEN`).\n3. Bump the version in [__about__.py](src/devmemory/__about__.py) (e.g. `0.1.0.dev1`) and re-run the build + `twine upload` — PyPI rejects re-uploading an existing version."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":609,"cache_read_input_tokens":253965,"output_tokens":704,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":72},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":609,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":704,"cache_read_input_tokens":253965,"cache_creation_input_tokens":609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":609},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CemxXkE5suvLP2CojZaY4","type":"assistant","uuid":"3e0c396c-7ea3-4dfe-a7ee-e8cd05c0febe","timestamp":"2026-09-06T09:35:28.529Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek","sessionId":"fcec3b82-fe78-4cb6-b1dc-40e4f8a72893","version":"2.1.263","gitBranch":"docs/project-details","slug":"buzzing-baking-crystal"}
