{"parentUuid":"f65960ea-cf92-4284-ba0a-88e3c430267f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CemyJdtbKTfjur3RqCPaN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Three parts.\n\n## 1. Get your data into Databricks\n\n```powershell\ncd D:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek\n$env:DATABRICKS_HOST = \"https://<your-workspace>.cloud.databricks.com\"\n$env:DATABRICKS_TOKEN = \"<pat>\"\n$env:DATABRICKS_WAREHOUSE_ID = \"<sql-warehouse-id>\"\ndevmemory databricks push        # creates devmemory.analytics.* and publishes rows\ndevmemory databricks status      # confirm\n```\n\n## 2. Create the Genie space (Databricks web UI)\n\n1. Databricks workspace → left nav → **Genie** → **New**.\n2. **Warehouse**: pick the same SQL warehouse.\n3. **Tables**: add the `devmemory.analytics` schema — `fact_versions`, `fact_changed_files`, `fact_metrics`, `fact_tests`, `fact_regressions`.\n4. (Optional) add sample questions / column descriptions so answers are better.\n5. Save. Copy the **space ID** from the URL: `.../genie/rooms/<SPACE_ID>`.\n\n## 3. Point DevMemory at it\n\nEither env var:\n```powershell\n$env:DATABRICKS_GENIE_SPACE_ID = \"<SPACE_ID>\"\ndevmemory serve\n```\nor in `.devmemory/config.json`:\n```json\n\"databricks\": { \"enabled\": true, \"genie_space_id\": \"<SPACE_ID>\" }\n```\n\nOpen the dashboard → **Ask**. It'll flip from the setup card to the chat.\n\n## 4. Republish to PyPI (version already used, must bump)"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":805,"cache_read_input_tokens":255449,"output_tokens":846,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":131},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":805,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":846,"cache_read_input_tokens":255449,"cache_cr