{"parentUuid":"37196f57-9053-4739-80d8-5cfd0776a556","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CemyQPquYrmeBkWAWK5s9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Replace the 4 values in the first block, paste the rest as-is.\n\n```powershell\n# ---- fill these in once ----\n$env:DATABRICKS_HOST         = \"https://YOUR-WORKSPACE.cloud.databricks.com\"\n$env:DATABRICKS_TOKEN        = \"dapiXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX\"\n$env:DATABRICKS_WAREHOUSE_ID = \"abcd1234efgh5678\"\n$env:DATABRICKS_GENIE_SPACE_ID = \"01efYOURSPACEID\"\n```\n\n```powershell\n# ---- push telemetry to Databricks ----\ncd D:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek\ndevmemory databricks push\ndevmemory databricks status\n```\n\n```powershell\n# ---- run the dashboard with Genie enabled ----\ndevmemory serve\n```\n\nThen open the dashboard → **Ask**.\n\nWhere each value comes from:\n- **HOST** — your browser URL when logged into Databricks (just the `https://...databricks.com` part).\n- **TOKEN** — Databricks → user avatar → **Settings → Developer → Access tokens → Generate**.\n- **WAREHOUSE_ID** — **SQL Warehouses** → click your warehouse → the ID in the URL or the \"Connection details\" tab.\n- **GENIE_SPACE_ID** — after you create the Genie space, it's in the URL: `.../genie/rooms/01ef...`."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":476,"cache_read_input_tokens":257933,"output_tokens":613,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":111},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":476,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":613,"cache_read_input_tokens":257933,"cache_creation_input_tokens":476,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":476},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics