{"parentUuid":"32fb8a35-94de-408d-a870-30f1bae730b8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CemyTDsDfD9kLGhD965TX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"From `.env.bak` — HOST/TOKEN/WAREHOUSE filled in. Genie space ID still a placeholder (you haven't created the space yet — step below).\n\n```powershell\n$env:DATABRICKS_HOST         = \"https://dbc-1b5e869b-0d1a.cloud.databricks.com\"\n$env:DATABRICKS_TOKEN        = \"REDACTED\"\n$env:DATABRICKS_WAREHOUSE_ID = \"9d0fe00fe4756c71\"\n```\n\n```powershell\ncd D:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek\ndevmemory databricks push\ndevmemory databricks status\n```\n\nNow create the Genie space (Databricks UI → **Genie** → **New** → same warehouse → add the `devmemory.analytics` tables → Save → copy the ID from `.../genie/rooms/<ID>`), then:\n\n```powershell\n$env:DATABRICKS_GENIE_SPACE_ID = \"PASTE_SPACE_ID_HERE\"\ndevmemory serve\n```\n\nOpen the dashboard → **Ask**.\n\n⚠️ That Databricks token (and the OpenAI/Gemini keys in `.env.bak`) are now in this chat transcript — rotate them after the hackathon."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":568,"cache_read_input_tokens":259080,"output_tokens":650,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":209},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":568,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":650,"cache_read_input_tokens":259080,"cache_creation_input_tokens":568,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":568},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CemyT9MrSn22515A5zRni","type":"assistant","uuid":"3e5280df-fc1e-49cb-b961-88b251e6cf95","timestamp":"2026-09-06T09:47:31.784Z","effort":"high","userType":"ext