{"parentUuid":"17a959e0-37b7-4e55-9fd3-13d259d0cb77","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cemye5Vz7RrNGF3bf5RSD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1161,"cache_read_input_tokens":260354,"output_tokens":624,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":129},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1161,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":624,"cache_read_input_tokens":260354,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1161},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cemydz54Xdqt5vkesdVBQ","type":"assistant","uuid":"cc2d39dc-b89a-47a6-a9aa-64021b3c9235","timestamp":"2026-09-06T09:49:54.025Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek","sessionId":"fcec3b82-fe78-4cb6-b1dc-40e4f8a72893","version":"2.1.263","gitBranch":"docs/project-details","slug":"buzzing-baking-crystal"}
{"parentUuid":"cc2d39dc-b89a-47a6-a9aa-64021b3c9235","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cemye5Vz7RrNGF3bf5RSD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't query your workspace (blocked), so — the Genie space **warehouse picker only lists Serverless or Pro SQL warehouses** that you have \"Can use\" on. If your warehouse is **Classic**, it won't show up. That's the usual cause.\n\nFixes, fastest first:\n\n1. **Check your warehouse type**: SQL → **SQL Warehouses** → click it → look at \"Type\". If it says **Classic**, that's the problem.\n\n2. **Create a Serverless one** (2 min): SQL Warehouses → **Create SQL warehouse** → Size *2X-Small* → Type **Serverless** (if the toggle is greyed out, serverless isn't enabled for the workspace — see #4) → Create. Then use this one in the Genie space, and also update:\n   ```powershell\n   $env:DATABRICKS_WAREHOUSE_ID = \"<new-serverless-warehouse-id>\"\n   ```\n\n3. **Or upgrade the existing one**: SQL Warehouses → your warehouse → **Edit** → Type → **Pro** or **Serverless** → Save.\n\n4. **If serverless is unavailable**: Settings → **Compute** → enable \"Serverless compute for SQL warehouses\" (needs account-admin; may not be available in your region/tier). A **Pro** warehouse also works and doesn't need serverless.\n\n5. Make sure the warehouse is **Running** (or set to auto-start) and that under its **Permissions** you have at least *Can use*."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1161,"cache_read_input_tokens":260354,"output_tokens":624,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":129},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1161,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":624,"cache_read_input_tokens":260354,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1161},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cemydz54Xdqt5vkesdVBQ","type":"assistant","uuid":"108ff119-1e6f-435d-8cd3-564d0ff2bded","timestamp":"2026-09-06T09:50:00.796Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek","sessionId":"fcec3b82-fe78-4cb6-b1dc-40e4f8a72893","version":"2.1.263","gitBranch":"docs/project-details","slug":"buzzing-baking-crystal"}
