{"parentUuid":"929dc0a1-074c-480f-8685-ee0706a16b65","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CemysnYuRhtGjJ9fCtn9z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That's the warehouse-permissions filter. The Genie \"New\" dialog only lists warehouses where **your user** has explicit **CAN USE** — the Serverless Starter Warehouse is usually admin-only by default, even while it's running.\n\nFix (screenshot 2 has the button):\n\n1. **SQL Warehouses → Serverless Starter Warehouse → Permissions** (the 🔒 button top-right).\n2. Add `banubb2005@gmail.com` → **Can use** → Save. (Or add \"All users → Can use\".)\n3. Go back to **Genie → New**, hard-reload the page first (Ctrl+Shift+R).\n4. In the dialog: give it a name → add tables `devmemory.analytics.*` → the warehouse dropdown should now show it.\n\nIf it's *still* missing after that, create it from the other direction: **Catalog → `devmemory` → `analytics` schema → Create ▾ → Genie space** — that pre-selects the tables and you just pick the warehouse."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1932,"cache_read_input_tokens":265736,"output_tokens":1212,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":879},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1932,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1212,"cache_read_input_tokens":265736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1932,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1932},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CemysdauM3Mkj1SJqWYNF","type":"assistant","uuid":"664b68f4-8018-4b82-8616-4a7997fdb677","timestamp":"2026-09-06T09:53:15.441Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","c