{"parentUuid":"a486aa2f-362d-462f-a474-0a6b853b7ef4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cemzr1NQ1VnnXnM31aLKD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done — the data is now in Databricks. `devmemory databricks push` published all 6 versions to **`workspace.devmemory`** (5 tables: `fact_versions`, `fact_changed_files`, `fact_metrics`, `fact_tests`, `fact_regressions`).\n\nI changed `/tmp/tl-demo/.devmemory/config.json` → catalog `workspace`, schema `devmemory` (the `devmemory` catalog you saw missing doesn't exist in your Unity Catalog; `workspace` does).\n\nNow in that **\"Connect your data\"** dialog:\n\n1. Click **`workspace`** → **`devmemory`** → check all 5 `fact_*` tables → **Create**.\n2. When it asks for a **warehouse**, pick **Serverless Starter Warehouse**.\n3. Once the space opens, copy its ID from the URL: `.../genie/rooms/`**`01ef…`**\n\nThen:\n\n```powershell\n$env:DATABRICKS_HOST           = \"https://dbc-1b5e869b-0d1a.cloud.databricks.com\"\n$env:DATABRICKS_TOKEN          = \"REDACTED\"\n$env:DATABRICKS_WAREHOUSE_ID   = \"9d0fe00fe4756c71\"\n$env:DATABRICKS_GENIE_SPACE_ID = \"01ef...\"   # paste the ID from step 3\ncd C:\\Users\\BANU\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\tl-demo\ndevmemory serve\n```\n\nDashboard → **Ask** → the chat is live. Try *\"Which features regressed and by how much?\"*"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":668,"cache_read_input_tokens":276403,"output_tokens":750,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":186},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":668,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":750,"cache_read_input_tokens":276403,"cache_creation_input_tokens":668,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_in