{"parentUuid":"4492ce99-2541-4012-87af-e64e73ad153f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cen2QGVz8NsnTo48vAJUr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":318,"cache_read_input_tokens":304158,"output_tokens":535,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":151},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":318,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":535,"cache_read_input_tokens":304158,"cache_creation_input_tokens":318,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":318},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cen2Q86U6wbJF8tLRkRut","type":"assistant","uuid":"d3039c3a-d963-49fc-89bb-23260e396f40","timestamp":"2026-09-06T10:26:08.080Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek","sessionId":"fcec3b82-fe78-4cb6-b1dc-40e4f8a72893","version":"2.1.263","gitBranch":"docs/project-details","slug":"buzzing-baking-crystal"}
{"parentUuid":"d3039c3a-d963-49fc-89bb-23260e396f40","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cen2QGVz8NsnTo48vAJUr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ **Deployed** — `devmemory-cli 0.1.0.dev1` is live: https://pypi.org/project/devmemory-cli/0.1.0.dev1/\n\n(The JSON API is cached a few minutes, but twine confirmed the upload — both files went up, no errors.)\n\nThis build has everything from this session: Genie chat, project brief (SSOT), auto-loop, the no-cache + subnav fixes, and the `genie_space_id` config field.\n\nUpgrade the global install:\n```powershell\npip install --pre --upgrade devmemory-cli\npython -m devmemory --version      # 0.1.0.dev1\n```\n\nIf `--upgrade` still shows dev0, wait ~2 min for the PyPI index to refresh, or force it:\n```powershell\npip install --pre --upgrade --no-cache-dir \"devmemory-cli==0.1.0.dev1\"\n```\n\nThen `python -m devmemory serve` in `tl-demo` will work (no more `genie_space_id` error), and the **Ask** tab is live against your Genie space.\n\n**Rotate that PyPI token now** — it's been used in plaintext several times in this session."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":318,"cache_read_input_tokens":304158,"output_tokens":535,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":151},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":318,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":535,"cache_read_input_tokens":304158,"cache_creation_input_tokens":318,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":318},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cen2Q86U6wbJF8tLRkRut","type":"assistant","uuid":"fee9f0ec-9e03-4d86-8c4b-df5c0fdf32f5","timestamp":"2026-09