{"parentUuid":"42ca3efd-cbaf-47b1-8d41-db43f54b6be5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7880d82c-265a-4bca-a786-f6cb7147359f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Vm7orLvAzUa4jpa5y2AMMt","type":"tool_result","content":"entire graph adds a deterministic, no-egress code graph to Entire checkpoints.\n\nUsage:\n  entire graph <command> [flags]\n\nSet up your agent:\n  init-agents      Install the coding-agent guide into AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md\n  agent-guide      Print the coding-agent operating guide\n  index            Build/warm a committed-tree cache variant for matching queries\n  capabilities     List parsed languages, relation types, and features\n\nInspect the graph:\n  search           Find the code for a task from a plain-language query (start here)\n  neighbors        Who calls this / what does it call (targeted relations)\n  impact           One-shot blast radius for changing a symbol\n  def              What a name IS: declaration, fields, and method surface\n  explain          Resolve symbols named by a failing build or test\n  symbols          Stream every symbol definition (bulk NDJSON)\n  edges            Stream every relation (bulk NDJSON)\n  snapshot         Stream the whole graph: files, symbols, and relations (bulk NDJSON)\n  snapshot-query   Query a compact snapshot without rebuilding the graph\n\nAnalyze changes & more:\n  commit           Entity-level change list for a commit vs its first parent\n  diff             Entity-level change list between two refs\n  checkpoint       Analyze the commit behind an Entire-Checkpoint trailer\n  verify           Run a test command and return an adjudicated verdict, not test output\n  stats            Human report: graph usage vs grep/read, and estimated token savings\n\nHelp & diagnostics:\n  help             Show this command listing\n  doctor           Diagnose the environment and confirm no-egress\n  version          Print the plugin version (and provider name with --json)\n\nUse \"entire graph <command> --help\" for details on a command.\nFor coding agents: run \"entire graph agent-guide\" or \"entire graph init-agents\".\n=== change_guidance uses graph? ===","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9b76bc7b-aaf3-44e7-8207-cd35c9d1ed3b","timestamp":"2026-09-06T11:19:31.732Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"42ca3efd-cbaf-47b1-8d41-db43f54b6be5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek","sessionId":"fcec3b82-fe78-4cb6-b1dc-40e4f8a72893","version":"2.1.263","gitBranch":"docs/project-details","slug":"buzzing-baking-crystal"}
