{"parentUuid":"e5b4a3e9-5678-419c-8a1c-778a98e9332c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cen8UUKCgZJ2oUDY56gJE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":321,"cache_read_input_tokens":414934,"output_tokens":861,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":44},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":321,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":861,"cache_read_input_tokens":414934,"cache_creation_input_tokens":321,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":321},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cen8ULLUoUdVLZpDxRyGK","type":"assistant","uuid":"b9fbbed8-a821-4e7c-9a07-ed93ff7e4af9","timestamp":"2026-09-06T11:45:43.721Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek","sessionId":"fcec3b82-fe78-4cb6-b1dc-40e4f8a72893","version":"2.1.263","gitBranch":"docs/project-details","slug":"buzzing-baking-crystal"}
{"parentUuid":"b9fbbed8-a821-4e7c-9a07-ed93ff7e4af9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cen8UUKCgZJ2oUDY56gJE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pushed to `docs/project-details` (`7ba4ad5`). Full test suite running in the background — I'll flag any failures.\n\n## What landed — the Entire graph, used properly\n\n**Tier 1 — pre-change blast radius** ([e020848](.))\n- `GraphAdapter.symbol_impact()` → `entire graph impact`: direct + transitive callers, callees, type consumers, co-changing files, a `blast_radius` number.\n- `GraphAdapter.diff_impact(base, head)` → `entire graph diff`: cumulative entity changes between any two refs.\n- **\"Safe to change?\"** and MCP `check_before_change` now take `symbols` (names or `file.py:line`) and answer from the *live graph*, not just history. High fan-out escalates the verdict (≥8 → caution, ≥20 → high-risk) and is spelled out. New \"Code-graph blast radius\" card in the dashboard — verified: `pricing/core.py:8` → 4 dependents, lists `cart_total`, `invoice_row`, `refund_amount`, `quote (via cart_total)`.\n- State-loop impact tile now uses the diff since the task's `base_commit`, not just the last commit.\n\n**Tier 2 — locate & confirm** ([7ba4ad5](.))\n- `GraphAdapter.search()` → `entire graph search`: ranked `file:line` for a plain-language query.\n- Requirement evaluation runs a graph search per pending requirement — a hit inside a file the task changed is real \"the code exists\" evidence and reads that way in the verdict (verified: \"round money to two decimals\" → matched `round_money` in `pricing/core.py`).\n- New MCP tools: `graph_search`, `symbol_blast_radius`.\n\n**Tier 3 — make it \"just work\"** ([7ba4ad5](.))\n- `devmemory doctor` now shows whether Entire is *enabled in this repo* (yours isn't — that's why the footer says \"Entire off\" and no sessions are captured).\n- `devmemory doctor --fix` runs `entire enable` + `entire plugin install graph`.\n\n**Honest gap:** full native session capture (a `sessions` table fed by MCP client identity, so `agent`/`model` populate with zero Entire) I scoped but did not build — it's a real design, not a quick wire. `doctor --fix` + `entire enable` is the path for now; run it in `tl-demo` and sessions start flowing."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":321,"cache_read_input_tokens":414934,"output_tokens":861,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":44},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":321,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":861,"cache_read_input_tokens":414934,"cache_creation_input_tokens":321,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":321},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cen8ULLUoUdVLZpDxRyGK","type":"assistant","uuid":"6a7107eb-14cb-433a-b99b-42dea56292db","timestamp":"2026-09-06T11:45:54.148Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek","sessionId":"fcec3b82-fe78-4cb6-b1dc-40e4f8a72893","version":"2.1.263","gitBranch":"docs/project-details","slug":"buzzing-baking-crystal"}
