{"parentUuid":"5fd28e5b-0dea-4a52-82ca-060595e9eda3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cen9KJ7u3ytjpxQgyiuVV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You already have two in `.env.bak` — try those first:\n\n```powershell\n# tl-demo\\.env\nOPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-5a0Kem…          # from .env.bak line 4\nGEMINI_API_KEY=AQ.Ab8RN6K_…             # from .env.bak line 5\n```\n```jsonc\n// config.json\n\"analysis\": { \"providers\": [\"openai\", \"gemini\", \"rules\"] }\n```\n`devmemory doctor` will tell you which key the env actually has, and the first working one wins.\n\n**Free, from scratch — best options for DevMemory's providers:**\n\n| Source | How | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Google AI Studio** (Gemini) | [aistudio.google.com/app/apikey](https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey) → \"Create API key\" | Best free tier. No card. Key starts `AIza…`. Use `providers: [\"gemini\",\"rules\"]`. |\n| **OpenRouter free models** | [openrouter.ai/keys](https://openrouter.ai/keys) (needs a valid account — yours 401s) | Set `analysis.model` to a `:free` id, e.g. `google/gemini-2.0-flash-exp:free`, `deepseek/deepseek-r1:free`, `meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free`. Rate-limited; some need a one-time $10 to unlock higher limits. |\n| **Groq / Cerebras** | console.groq.com / cloud.cerebras.ai | Genuinely free + fast, **but** DevMemory has no provider for them and our OpenAI path uses the Responses API they don't support — would need ~15 lines of adapter code. Tell me if you want it. |\n\nFastest path: grab a Gemini key from AI Studio (2 minutes, no card), drop it in `.env`, set `providers: [\"gemini\", \"rules\"]`."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":579,"cache_read_input_tokens":440340,"output_tokens":1800,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1159},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service