{"parentUuid":"83ba90e2-cda2-4871-922b-06af7b5de095","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7880d82c-265a-4bca-a786-f6cb7147359f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PTXNvc4tNGBBxdQse4kiiH","type":"tool_result","content":"V2  gemini · gemini-flash-latest  risk high\r\n\r\n┌─ summary ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\r\n│ The change adds a tier parameter to apply_discount across 2 files, but      │\r\n│ introduces a confirmed performance regression. While all 24 tests passed,   │\r\n│ quote_latency_ms worsened from 42.0 to 47.0, representing an 11.9%          │\r\n│ increase. A prior attempt on the same files also resulted in a latency      │\r\n│ regression.                                                                 │\r\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\n\r\nreasoning: Modifications to apply_discount and line_total increased \r\nquote_latency_ms by 5.0 ms. Despite passing functional tests, the 11.9% latency\r\ndegradation and the history of latency issues in prior attempt v3 indicate that\r\nthe change introduces unacceptable performance overhead.\r\n\r\nrecommendation: Reject the change and profile apply_discount and line_total to \r\neliminate the 5.0 ms increase in quote_latency_ms.\r\n! quote_latency_ms regressed by 11.9% from 42.0 to 47.0.\r\n! Previous attempt v3 also experienced a quote_latency_ms regression.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d4c4adbb-2b74-476f-84c9-8163bff6b718","timestamp":"2026-09-06T12:03:05.118Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"83ba90e2-cda2-4871-922b-06af7b5de095","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"d:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek","sessionId":"fcec3b82-fe78-4cb6-b1dc-40e4f8a72893","version":"2.1.263","gitBranch":"docs/project-details","slug":"buzzing-baking-crystal"}
