{"parentUuid":"94c41a43-57b1-41cf-aa7b-4b692673958f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Ceosevrg2JSP9Ekg7Hoc8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✅ **Deployed** — `devmemory-cli 0.1.0.dev2` is live: https://pypi.org/project/devmemory-cli/0.1.0.dev2/\n\n```powershell\npip install --pre --upgrade devmemory-cli    # → 0.1.0.dev2\n```\n\nThis build carries everything from the session: Genie chat, SSOT project brief, auto-loop, the graph blast-radius integration, `graph_search` / `symbol_blast_radius` MCP tools, `doctor --fix`, and the OpenRouter + Gemini LLM providers. Version bump committed and pushed (`0068c22`).\n\n---\n\nNow, `/design` — what would you like to design? A few things it'd fit for this project:\n- **Landing page** for `devmemory-cli` (what it is, install, the loop, the dashboard)\n- **Architecture / flow diagram** (Git + Entire + tests + graph → NormalizedState → loop → IDE)\n- **Pitch deck / one-pager** for the hackathon\n- A **dashboard screen** redesign or a specific new view\n\nTell me which (or something else) and I'll build it as an editable design canvas."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":315,"cache_read_input_tokens":429896,"output_tokens":784,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":397},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":315,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":784,"cache_read_input_tokens":429896,"cache_creation_input_tokens":315,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":315},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CeoserxWtDKAUooYGiERa","type":"assistant","uuid":"28187710-2d55-4c83-bec3-7cd0de67cbb2","timestamp":"2026