          <span class=\"mono tnum\" style=\"color:#565c6b;\">24 / 0</span>\n            <span class=\"mono tnum\" style=\"color:#0e6b4d;\">−9%</span>\n            <span style=\"justify-self:end;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#0e6b4d;\"><span style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#12805c;\"></span>landed</span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr 96px 74px 88px; gap:12px; padding:11px 24px; align-items:center; border-bottom:1px solid #f1f2f5; background:#fdf2f2;\">\n            <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:#b31b28;\">v3</span>\n            <span>Widen the premium discount to win back the regression</span>\n            <span class=\"mono tnum\" style=\"color:#565c6b;\">24 / 0</span>\n            <span class=\"mono tnum\" style=\"color:#b31b28;\">+4%</span>\n            <span style=\"justify-self:end;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#b31b28;\"><span style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#cf2230;\"></span>regressed</span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr 96px 74px 88px; gap:12px; padding:11px 24px; align-items:center; border-bottom:1px solid #f1f2f5; background:#fdf2f2;\">\n            <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:#b31b28;\">v2</span>\n            <span>Add a tier parameter to apply_discount</span>\n            <span class=\"mono tnum\" style=\"color:#565c6b;\">24 / 0</span>\n            <span class=\"mono tnum\" style=\"color:#b31b28;\">+12%</span>\n            <span style=\"justify-self:end;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#b31b28;\"><span style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#cf2230;\"></span>regressed</span></span>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr 96px 74px 88px; gap:12px; padding:11px 24px; align-items:center;\">\n            <span class=\"mono\" style=\"color:#878d9b;\">v1</span>\n            <span>Add a with_tax helper for regional tax rates</span>\n            <span class=\"mono tnum\" style=\"color:#565c6b;\">24 / 0</span>\n            <span class=\"mono tnum\" style=\"color:#878d9b;\">—</span>\n            <span style=\"justify-self:end;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#0e6b4d;\"><span style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#12805c;\"></span>landed</span></span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- quote_latency trend -->\n        <div style=\"padding:18px 24px 22px; border-top:1px solid #eef0f3;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px; color:#878d9b; margin-bottom:8px;\">quote_latency_ms &nbsp;·&nbsp; v1 → v6</div>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 90\" width=\"100%\" height=\"90\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" style=\"overflow:visible;\">\n            <polyline points=\"10,52 128,52 246,20 364,8 482,44 590,66\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5b53e8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"246\" cy=\"20\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#cf2230\"/><circle cx=\"364\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#cf2230\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"590\" cy=\"66\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#5b53e8\"/>\n            <text x=\"590\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#878d9b\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"'IBM Plex Mono',monospace\">38ms</text>\n            <text x=\"10\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#878d9b\" font-family=\"'IBM Plex Mono',monospace\">42ms</text>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- right rail -->\n      <aside style=\"padding:13px 22px 24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:20px;\">\n\n        <!-- repeated failure -->\n        <div style=\"border-left:3px solid #cf2230; padding:2px 0 2px 13px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.05em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#b31b28; margin-bottom:6px;\">Repeated failure · 2×</div>\n          <div class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:#565c6b; line-height:1.6;\">metrics.json, pricing/core.py</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12.5px; color:#565c6b; margin-top:6px; line-height:1.55;\">The same file signature regressed in <a>v2</a> and <a>v3</a>. Read both before touching discounts again.</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"height:1px; background:#e6e7ec;\"></div>\n\n        <!-- feature health -->\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-bottom:10px;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.05em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#565c6b;\">Feature health</div>\n            <a style=\"font-size:12px; font-weight:500;\">all →</a>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;\">\n            <div>\n              <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; margin-bottom:5px;\">\n                <span style=\"font-size:13px; font-weight:500;\">discounts</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#b31b28;\">at risk</span>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"display:flex; gap:3px;\">\n                <span style=\"flex:1; height:5px; border-radius:2px; background:#cf2230;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"flex:1; height:5px; border-radius:2px; background:#cf2230;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"flex:1; height:5px; border-radius:2px; background:#12805c;\"></span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; margin-bottom:5px;\">\n                <span style=\"font-size:13px; font-weight:500;\">rounding</span>\n                <span style=\"font-size