\" style=\"font-weight:600; font-size:16px;\">DevMemory</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"padding:7px 9px; border-radius:7px; color:#6f6a60;\">Overview</div>\n    <div style=\"padding:7px 9px; border-radius:7px; color:#6f6a60;\">Ask</div>\n    <div style=\"padding:7px 9px; border-radius:7px; background:#e6e2d9; color:#1b1a17; font-weight:500;\">Tasks</div>\n    <div style=\"padding:7px 9px; border-radius:7px; color:#6f6a60;\">Timeline</div>\n    <div style=\"padding:7px 9px; border-radius:7px; color:#6f6a60;\">Features</div>\n    <div style=\"padding:7px 9px; border-radius:7px; color:#6f6a60;\">Intelligence</div>\n    <div style=\"padding:7px 9px; border-radius:7px; color:#6f6a60;\">Safe to change?</div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <main style=\"min-width:0;\">\n    <div style=\"height:52px; border-bottom:1px solid #e7e3db; display:flex; align-items:center; padding:0 26px;\">\n      <div class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:12px; color:#8a8377;\">2ebe9eb1 &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#57534a;\">chore: ignore __pycache__</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#855800;\">uncheckpointed</span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"max-width:1160px; margin:0 auto; padding:28px 40px 72px;\">\n\n      <!-- header -->\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px;\">\n        <div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#8a8377;\"><a>Tasks</a> / <span class=\"mono\">TASK-001</span></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-top:7px;\">\n            <span class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:600;\">TASK-001</span>\n            <span style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:#0e6b4d; background:#e4f2ea; border:1px solid #b9ddca; border-radius:999px; padding:2px 9px;\">● READY</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:19px; font-weight:400; margin-top:8px; color:#2c2924;\">Add a currency-rounding helper and use it in cart_total; relevant tests exist and pass.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; flex:none;\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex; border:1px solid #dcd7cc; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; font-size:12px; font-weight:500;\">\n            <span style=\"padding:6px 11px; background:#4b41d1; color:#fff;\">Auto</span>\n            <span style=\"padding:6px 11px; color:#8a8377;\">Manual</span>\n          </div>\n          <button style=\"border:1px solid #dcd7cc; background:#fff; border-radius:8px; padding:6px 11px; font-size:12px; font-weight:500; display:inline-flex; gap:6px; align-items:center;\">\n            <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><path d=\"M4 12a8 8 0 0 1 14-5m2-2v5h-5M20 12a8 8 0 0 1-14 5m-2 2v-5h5\"/></svg>Refresh\n          </button>\n          <button style=\"border:1px solid #4b41d1; background:#4b41d1; color:#fff; border-radius:8px; padding:6px 11px; font-size:12px; font-weight:500;\">Evaluate completion</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- hero line + status -->\n      <p class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:19px; font-weight:400; line-height:1.5; color:#2c2924; margin:22px 0 0; max-width:64ch;\">\n        All three requirements check out against a clean tree, 24 tests pass, nothing is open. Safe to stop.\n      </p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; margin-top:14px; padding-left:16px; border-left:3px solid #0e6b4d; font-size:13px; color:#3d3a33;\">\n        <span style=\"font-weight:600; color:#0e6b4d;\">READY</span> · snapshot #3 · refreshed 2m ago\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- stat row -->\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); border:1px solid #e7e3db; border-radius:12px; background:#fff; margin-top:22px; overflow:hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"padding:14px 16px; border-right:1px solid #f0ece3;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#8a8377;\">Requirements</div>\n          <div class=\"tnum\" style=\"font-size:20px; font-weight:600;\">3 / 3</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px; color:#8a8377;\">all complete</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding:14px 16px; border-right:1px solid #f0ece3;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#8a8377;\">Tests</div>\n          <div class=\"tnum\" style=\"font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:#0e6b4d;\">24 pass</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px; color:#8a8377;\">0 failed · passed</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding:14px 16px; border-right:1px solid #f0ece3;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#8a8377;\">Working tree</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#0e6b4d; line-height:1.5;\">clean</div>\n          <div class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:11px; color:#8a8377;\">+8 / −2 · 2 files</div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"padding:14px 16px;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#8a8377;\">Impact</div>\n          <div class=\"tnum\" style=\"font-size:20px; font-weight:600;\">2 files</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:11px; color:#8a8377;\">1 test · entire graph</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- two columns -->\n      <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 330px; gap:28px; margin-top:30px; align-items:start;\">\n\n        <!-- left -->\n        <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:26px;\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"sect\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px;\">Requirements</div>\n            <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n              <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:96px 1fr; gap:14px; padding:11px 0; border-bottom:1px sol