{"parentUuid":"d75e8e0e-ee55-4582-ae70-892b9549fec2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5bbddbb1-bc91-43d1-9778-b85a5f814549","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LG94S5sn1A3wkvumNWavTG","type":"tool_result","content":"### STATE_LOOP 12-30\n```\n\n## Try it\n\nAny DevMemory project works. Seed the demo, then drive the loop:\n\n```bash\npython examples/demo/seed.py /tmp/devmemory-demo && cd /tmp/devmemory-demo\n\ndevmemory task new \"Add a currency helper to pricing/ and a test for it\" \\\n    --test \"python -m pytest -q\"\ndevmemory task state                 # the dashboard: NEEDS_WORK, requirements 0/2\n\n# ... agent inspects the repo, implements pricing/currency.py + a test, commits ...\n\ndevmemory task requirement R1 -s complete -m \"added pricing/currency.py\"\ndevmemory task refresh               # re-collects evidence; R2 (tests) verified\ndevmemory task state                 # READY\ndevmemory task history               # snapshot #1 NEEDS_WORK → #2 READY\n### details 212-224\n\n```\ndevmemory/\n├── pyproject.toml                  # build, deps, lint, test config\n├── README.md\n├── CHANGELOG.md\n├── DEMO.md\n├── AGENTS.md                       # agent operating protocol\n├── LICENSE\n│\n├── docs/\n│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md\n│   ├── PROJECT_SPEC.md\n### details 598-614\n\n# Tests (parallel)\npytest -n auto\n\n# Tests with coverage\npytest --cov=devmemory --cov-report=term-missing\n\n# Demo\npython examples/demo/seed.py /tmp/devmemory-demo && cd /tmp/devmemory-demo\ndevmemory serve\n\n# Health check\ndevmemory doctor\n```\n\n---\n\n### ARCH 250-262\n├── docs/\n│   ├── PROJECT_SPEC.md\n│   ├── ENTIRE_QUICKSTART.md\n│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md\n│   ├── DATA_MODEL.md\n│   ├── API.md\n│   ├── DEVELOPMENT.md\n│   └── DEMO.md\n│\n├── src/\n│   └── devmemory/\n│       │\n│       ├── __init__.py\n### ARCH 314-326\n├── tests/\n│   ├── unit/\n│   ├── integration/\n│   └── fixtures/\n│\n└── examples/\n    └── demo-project/\n```\n\nThe structure can be simplified during implementation if necessary.\n\nDo not create empty abstractions purely for architectural appearance.\n\n### ARCH 2250-2275\n\n---\n\n# 56. Demo Environment\n\nCreate a small sample project:\n\n```text\nexamples/demo-project/\n```\n\nIt should be intentionally simple.\n\nExample:\n\n```text\ndemo-project/\n├── app.py\n├── calculator.py\n├── tests/\n│   └── test_calculator.py\n└── README.md\n```\n\nUse it to demonstrate:","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"04117d91-89ec-4200-b1ad-2df909aca53d","timestamp":"2026-09-07T21:24:58.396Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"### STATE_LOOP 12-30\n```\n\n## Try it\n\nAny DevMemory project works. Seed the demo, then drive the loop:\n\n```bash\npython examples/demo/seed.py /tmp/devmemory-demo && cd /tmp/devmemory-demo\n\ndevmemory task new \"Add a currency helper to pricing/ and a test for it\" \\\n    --test \"python -m pytest -q\"\ndevmemory task state                 # the dashboard: NEEDS_WORK, requirements 0/2\n\n# ... agent inspects the repo, implements pricing/currency.py + a test, commits ...\n\ndevmemory task requirement R1 -s complete -m \"added pricing/currency.py\"\ndevmemory task refresh               # re-collects evidence; R2 (tests) verified\ndevmemory task state                 # READY\ndevmemory task history               # snapshot #1 NEEDS_WORK → #2 READY\n### details 212-224\n\n```\ndevmemory/\n├── pyproject.toml                  # build, deps, lint, test config\n├── README.md\n├── CHANGELOG.md\n├── DEMO.md\n├── AGENTS.md                       # agent operating protocol\n├── LICENSE\n│\n├── docs/\n│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md\n│   ├── PROJECT_SPEC.md\n### details 598-614\n\n# Tests (parallel)\npytest -n auto\n\n# Tests with coverage\npytest --cov=devmemory --cov-report=term-missing\n\n# Demo\npython examples/demo/seed.py /tmp/devmemory-demo && cd /tmp/devmemory-demo\ndevmemory serve\n\n# Health check\ndevmemory doctor\n```\n\n---\n\n### ARCH 250-262\n├── docs/\n│   ├── PROJECT_SPEC.md\n│   ├── ENTIRE_QUICKSTART.md\n│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md\n│   ├── DATA_MODEL.md\n│   ├── API.md\n│   ├── DEVELOPMENT.md\n│   └── DEMO.md\n│\n├── src/\n│   └── devmemory/\n│       │\n│       ├── __init__.py\n### ARCH 314-326\n├── tests/\n│   ├── unit/\n│   ├── integration/\n│   └── fixtures/\n│\n└── examples/\n    └── demo-project/\n```\n\nThe structure can be simplified during implementation if necessary.\n\nDo not create empty abstractions purely for architectural appearance.\n\n### ARCH 2250-2275\n\n---\n\n# 56. Demo Environment\n\nCreate a small sample project:\n\n```text\nexamples/demo-project/\n```\n\nIt should be intentionally simple.\n\nExample:\n\n```text\ndemo-project/\n├── app.py\n├── calculator.py\n├── tests/\n│   └── test_calculator.py\n└── README.md\n```\n\nUse it to demonstrate:","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d75e8e0e-ee55-4582-ae70-892b9549fec2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"D:\\Hackathons\\TechWeek","sessionId":"fcec3b82-fe78-4cb6-b1dc-40e4f8a72893","version":"2.1.263","gitBranch":"docs/project-details","slug":"buzzing-baking-crystal"}
